---
import Reveal from '../common/Reveal.astro';
import Section from '../common/Section.astro';
import Text from '../common/Text.astro';
---

<Section
    hideBorder
    title="About"
    buttonText="View Photos"
    href="/photos"
    class="gap-section-gap flex flex-col"
>
    <Reveal class="gap-section-gap flex flex-col">
        <Text variant="body-lg" class="max-w-2xl text-justify">
            I started coding in 6th grade. My teacher noticed that I&apos;d
            finished the typing lessons early and set me up on CodeAvengers to
            keep me occupied. Weeks later, I started building websites and
            games, and I haven't stopped since.
        </Text>

        <Text variant="body-lg" class="ml-auto max-w-2xl text-justify">
            That curiosity took me from web development to design engineering
            to low-level programming to high-performance computing. I graduated
            from DePaul University in Chicago studying Computer Science in
            2026.
        </Text>

        <Text variant="body-lg" class="max-w-2xl text-justify">
            Today, I&apos;m a founding engineer at LUX VITAE where I lead the
            team of engineers building ANTIK, the elevated interface for personal
            computing. I&apos;m based in Los Angeles.
        </Text>
    </Reveal>
</Section>
